1. Encryption Algorithms and Hash Functions
-------------------------------------------

The framework should provide support for multiple encryption algorithms (AES-128, AES-256, ChaCha20) and hash functions (SHA-256, SHA-384). The encryption algorithms and hash functions are implemented as separate modules, which can be loaded dynamically based on user input.
