We also include a logging mechanism within the function to record memory allocation failures or performance bottlenecks, aiding in debugging. We choose an appropriate buffer size to handle delays without excessive memory usage. Additionally, we optimize the function to handle up to 10,000 records, balancing memory management and error handling.

