4. Handles external data source integration, where the threshold value can change at runtime due to external configuration updates. The function designs a mechanism to gracefully handle potential synchronization issues when updating task statuses.
5. Considers the impact of these operations on memory usage and CPU load, optimizing for both performance and resource management in a multi-threaded application environment."]

