The function also includes validation steps to ensure that the parameters of the selected strategy meet predefined thresholds for effectiveness and feasibility. If any parameter fails validation, the function frees all allocated memory and returns an appropriate error status. Additionally, the function respects cooldown periods to prevent rapid consecutive activations of strategies.

